OL,3,ANone of UK government's #2.5bn steel
OL,4,Apackage spent in Wales, figures show
OL,5,
OL,6,FWales has not received any money from
OL,7,Fthe UK government's #2.5bn steel
OL,8,Findustry investment plan announced in
OL,9,FFebruary 2025, according to figures
OL,10,Fobtained through a Freedom of
OL,11,FInformation (FOI) request.
OL,13,FThe UK's Department for Business,
OL,14,FInnovation, Science and Trade confirmed
OL,15,Fthat "the government has not spent, nor
OL,16,Fallocated, nor committed any money
OL,17,Funder the #2.5bn commitment in Wales".
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
