OL,3,ANone of UK government's #2.5bn steel
OL,4,Apackage spent in Wales, figures show
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe FOI was obtained by the Liberal
OL,7,FDemocrats, whose Welsh leader David
OL,8,FChadwick said that Welsh Labour MPs
OL,9,Fneeded to "demand a fair share for
OL,10,FWelsh steel now, before their own
OL,11,Fgovernment spends the rest".
OL,13,FThe UK government said it had "invested
OL,14,Fextensively to secure steelmaking" in
OL,15,FPort Talbot.
